## MCP Tools Available in Claude Desktop

After connecting Claude Desktop (see `mcp/SETUP.md`), you can use:

- `agent_status` — Container state + balance + last log
- `get_agent_card` — Current agent card JSON
- `view_agent_logs` — Tail agent logs
- `get_balance` — AVT token balance
- `stake_tokens` — Lock units for governance weight
- `get_staking_positions` — View lock positions
- `get_governance_proposals` — Browse Agent Senate proposals
- `cast_vote` — Vote on a proposal
- `create_governance_proposal` — Create a new proposal
- `submit_attestation` — Submit ZKP attestation
- `list_circuits` — View bundled ZKP circuits
- `read_local_state` — Read local data files
- `view_transaction_history` — Past TEG transactions
- `start_agent` / `stop_agent` / `restart_agent` — Container lifecycle
- `get_container_logs` — Raw Docker logs

