## ZKP Attestation

This bundle includes pre-compiled ZKP circuits in `circuits/`.
To submit an attestation:
```
In Claude: "Submit an attestation using the fairMarkupPolicy circuit"
```
Claude will call `submit_attestation` which runs nargo + bb inside your Docker container.

To download newer circuits from the registry:
```
In Claude: "List available circuits and update any that are outdated"
```

---

## Upgrading

Pull the latest circuit list:
```
In Claude: "Update my circuits from the registry"
```

To update the agent software, re-download a fresh bundle from the OnboardingWizard
or update manually by checking the registry release notes.

